+This repo doesn't depend on any other Doc Detective repos.
+
+## API
+
+### `readFile(fileURL)`
+
+Reads a file from a remote HTTP/HTTPS URL or a local file path and returns its content. JSON and YAML content is parsed into an object; other formats are returned as raw strings. Returns `null` if the file can't be read.
+
+```javascript
+const { readFile } = require("doc-detective-common");
+
+const definition = await readFile("https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/swagger.json");
+```
+
+### `validate(schemaKey, object, addDefaults)`
+
+Validates `object` against the schema identified by `schemaKey`. If `addDefaults` is `true` (the default), validation applies schema defaults to `object`; if `false`, `object` isn't modified. Returns an object with `valid`, `errors`, and `object` properties. If `schemaKey` doesn't match a known schema, returns `valid: false` with an error message.
