 The `httpRequest` action makes arbitrary HTTP calls, allowing you to call and validate APIs and use web services.
 
+You can specify the request with a `url`, or reference an operation in an OpenAPI definition with an `openApi` object. When you use `openApi`, you can validate requests and responses against the OpenAPI schema, use examples from the definition, and mock responses for APIs that aren't fully implemented yet.
+
 > For comprehensive options, see the [`httpRequest`](/docs/references/schemas/httpRequest) reference.
